{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7670892057376770354","title":"操作系统工程师","description":"1. 协助完成端侧AI模型适配、算子移植、性能调优与精度验证,保障AI业务在嵌入式实时系统中高效、稳定运行。\n2.配合团队完成AI业务功能调试、问题排查、版本迭代与文档梳理,优化端侧AI推理的功耗、时延与内存占用。\n3. 跟进端侧AI与RTOS系统适配新技术,参与技术方案讨论与落地,支撑各类端侧智能业务场景落地。","requirement":"1. 硕士及以上学历,计算机、软件工程、电子信息、自动化、人工智能等相关专业。\n2. 掌握扎实的C/C++编程基础,熟悉Python基础语法,了解数据结构与常用算法。\n3. 了解RTOS实时操作系统基本原理,熟悉任务调度、内存管理、中断机制等基础概念,有嵌入式开发经验优先。\n4. 了解端侧AI、深度学习推理基础,熟悉常用轻量级推理框架、算子原理者优先.\n5. 具备良好的逻辑思维、学习能力和问题排查能力,责任心强,乐于团队协作,愿意深耕嵌入式端侧AI方向。","city_info":{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","i18n_name":"北京"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1786018812912,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7659311908839262514","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘计划","i18n":"2027届校园招聘计划"},"limit_count":2,"active_status":1},"job_function":{"id":"7178759516879405165","name":"软件研发类","en_name":"Software R\u0026D","i18n_name":"软件研发类"},"job_id":"7670892057376622898","city_list":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_name":"beijing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000001","node_status":1},{"code":"CT_107","name":"南京","en_name":"Nanjing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"南京","py_name":"nanjing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000121","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_l